@startuml AD6_RecitationWorkflow
!include act.iuml
title Activity Diagram – Recitation Workflow (interrelation of use cases)
|User|
start
:Select surah;
|Faseeh System|
:Display full surah\n(loadFromFile, getAyahList,\ngetUthmaniText);
|User|
:Select ayahs;
|Faseeh System|
:Get selected ayahs\n(getAyahRange);
|Faseeh System|
fork
  :Load reference data\n(loadReferenceData);
fork again
  :Create recording\n(createRecording);
  :Request microphone\npermission\n(requestMicPermission);
  if () then ([denied])
    stop
  else ([granted])
  endif
end fork
|User|
:Start reciting;
|Faseeh System|
:Record audio\n(startRecord, setStatus);
|User|
:Stop recording;
|Faseeh System|
:Save audio\n(stopRecord, setStatus);
|Faseeh System|
:Set status "analyzing"\nand send audio\n(setStatus, detectErrors,\ngetAudioData);
|AI Server|
:Detect pronunciation errors;
|Faseeh System|
:Create errors and\nhighlight words\n(create PronunciationError,\ncreate CorrectionInterface);
if () then ([no errors])
  :Show "no errors found";
  stop
else ([errors found])
endif
|User|
:Select highlighted word;
|Faseeh System|
:Build unified correction\n(loadErrorDetails);
:Show phonetic text, articulation\nimage and reciter audio\n(renderUnifiedFeedback);
stop
@enduml
